---
/* Cohort Builder: the three explored structures, each with a tiny wireframe. */
---
<div class="concepts">
  <article class="card">
    <div class="wire" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="stepper"><i class="on"></i><b></b><i></i><b></b><i></i><b></b><i></i></div>
      {[0, 1, 2, 3].map(() => <div class="field"><span></span><em></em></div>)}
    </div>
    <p class="label-s muted">Concept A</p>
    <h4 class="title">Guided wizard</h4>
    <p class="text">One linear stepper for everyone: category, then filters, then review.</p>
    <p class="plus">+ &nbsp;Familiar and structured.</p>
    <p class="text">– &nbsp;Slow for common cohorts; complex criteria turn into dozens of dropdowns.</p>
  </article>

  <article class="card">
    <div class="wire chat" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="msg" style="width:55%"></span>
      <span class="msg me" style="width:44%"></span>
      <span class="msg" style="width:62%"></span>
      <span class="msg me" style="width:33%"></span>
      <span class="input"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="label-s muted">Concept B</p>
    <h4 class="title">AI chat assistant</h4>
    <p class="text">Describe any cohort in a chat and let AI assemble it.</p>
    <p class="plus">+ &nbsp;Maximum flexibility.</p>
    <p class="text">– &nbsp;Hard to audit, no clinical validation, and a blank box stalls new users.</p>
  </article>

  <article class="card chosen">
    <div class="wire routes" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="cols">
        {[0, 1, 2].map((k) => <div class:list={["col", { first: k === 0 }]}><span class="bar"></span><span class="l1"></span><span class="l2"></span><span class="box"></span></div>)}
      </div>
      <span class="strip"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="label-row"><span class="label-s accent">Concept C</span><span class="chip label-s">Chosen</span></p>
    <h4 class="title">Three routes, one system</h4>
    <p class="text">Validated presets first, AI inside a clinical guardrail, and a request loop for gaps.</p>
    <p class="plus">+ &nbsp;Speed, precision and a path for everything else.</p>
    <p class="text">– &nbsp;More surface to design — solved with one shared category grid.</p>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .concepts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; align-items: stretch; }
  .card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .card.chosen { border: 2px solid var(--accent); }
  .wire { height: 190px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg-raised); padding: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .stepper { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .stepper i { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3a4744; flex: none; }
  .stepper i.on { background: var(--accent); }
  .stepper b { flex: 1; height: 2px; background: #3a4744; max-width: 40px; margin: 0 6px; }
  .field { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .field span { width: 70px; height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: #34403d; flex: none; }
  .field em { flex: 1; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #34403d; }
  .chat { justify-content: center; }
  .msg { height: 20px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--border); }
  .msg.me { background: var(--accent); align-self: flex-end; }
  .input { height: 28px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid #34403d; margin-top: 4px; }
  .routes { justify-content: center; }
  .cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; }
  .col { background: var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .bar { height: 4px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--text-secondary); }
  .first .bar { background: var(--accent); }
  .l1 { width: 70%; height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: #3a4744; }
  .l2 { width: 50%; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: #3a4744; }
  .box { height: 30px; border-radius: 4px; background: #34403d; margin-top: 4px; }
  .strip { height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--accent-soft); margin-top: 4px; }
  .label-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .chip { padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--text-on-accent); }
  .title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; }
  .text { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .plus { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-primary); }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) { .concepts { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .wire { max-width: 360px; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .text, .plus { font-size: 16px; } .card { padding: 20px; } }
</style>
